 "description": "Which codes are valid on a date for up to 50 Japanese municipalities? e-Stat LOD change history (CC BY 4.0): status mapped / split_candidates (all successors, not apportioned) / unknown / invalid, the code valid on as_of with English and Japanese names, change type and date, confirmed JMA warning areas only, and J-LIS convenience-store certificate availability (available / not_listed / unknown). Facts only; no document preparation or legal advice. Retrying with the same payment is not charged.",
